GlassineOS wvkbd
================

This branch is the on-screen keyboard of GlassineOS (https://github.com/GlassineOS):
wvkbd 0.16 (https://github.com/jjsullivan5196/wvkbd) plus two changes, one commit
each:

  - themable keys: --stroke, --stroke-sp, --stroke-width, --text-press,
    --text-press-sp, --gap, --no-popup (the shell passes its theme's look)
  - a German QWERTZ layer ("german") with umlauts

Without the new options the keyboard behaves as upstream's.

Branches:
  glassine/0.16   what GlassineOS builds (the release Alpine 3.22 packaged)

Build: as upstream (make; needs wayland, pango, cairo, xkbcommon, scdoc).

The license is upstream's (GPL-3.0, LICENSE). Commits made with AI assistance
carry an Assisted-by: trailer. They are not submitted upstream; see the
GlassineOS contribution policy.
